:false},{"page":108,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p108.webp","label":"p108","matched":false},{"page":109,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p109.webp","label":"p109","matched":false},{"page":110,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p110.webp","label":"p110","matched":false},{"page":111,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p111.webp","label":"p111","matched":false},{"page":112,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p112.webp","label":"p112","matched":false},{"page":113,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p113.webp","label":"p113","matched":false},{"page":114,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p114.webp","label":"p114","matched":false},{"page":115,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p115.webp","label":"p115","matched":false},{"page":116,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p116.webp","label":"p116","matched":false},{"page":117,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p117.webp","label":"p117","matched":false},{"page":118,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p118.webp","label":"p118","matched":false},{"page":119,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p119.webp","label":"p119","matched":false}]},"forumImages":[{"src":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/2/27097b149275120c07fa03b6d8c7ac2a0ad20f8d.jpeg","alt":"","width":1701,"height":2386,"postNumber":1}],"resources":[],"resourceCounts":{},"annotations":[],"learningTasks":[],"posts":[{"id":11194,"post_number":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"created_at":"2024-08-22T10:36:35Z","updated_at":"2024-08-22T10:36:35Z","like_count":0,"cooked":"<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/2/27097b149275120c07fa03b6d8c7ac2a0ad20f8d.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/5zkVTDZM47yhNxsCc70irVVeA57.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"\"><img src=\"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/2/27097b149275120c07fa03b6d8c7ac2a0ad20f8d.jpeg\" alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"5zkVTDZM47yhNxsCc70irVVeA57\" width=\"1701\" height=\"2386\"></a></div></p>\n<h3><a name=\"p-11194-h-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-11194-h-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>社会现实复杂多样，人间世相千姿百态</h3>\n<p>我们需要以正确的立场、睿智的头脑和敏锐的眼睛，去观察思考，分析鉴别。<br>\n本单元所选五篇小说，通过虚构的人物形象与故事情节反映社会生活，描摹人情世态，表达对人生的思索。阅读这些小说，可以丰富人生体验，提升对社会现实观察、分析、判断的能力，激发想象，培养高尚的审美情趣。</p>\n<p>学习本单元，要注意知人论世，在人物与社会环境共生、互动的关系中认识人物性格的形成和发展，关注作品的社会批判性。要了解作者如何运用多种艺术手法实现创作意图，品味小说在形象、情节、语言等方面的独特魅力，欣赏小说不同的风格类型；学习用读书提要或读书笔记记录自己的阅读感受和见解，借鉴小说技法进行创作。</p>","plain_text":"社会现实复杂多样,人间世相千姿百态 我们需要以正确的立场、睿智的头脑和敏锐的眼睛,去观察思考,分析鉴别。 本单元所选五篇小说,通过虚构的人物形象与故事情节反映社会生活,描摹人情世态,表达对人生的思索。阅读这些小说,可以丰富人生体验,提升对社会现实观察、分析、判断的能力,激发想象,培养高尚的审美情趣。 学习本单元,要注意知人论世,在人物与社会环境共生、互动的关系中认识人物性格的形成和发展,关注作品的社会批判性。要了解作者如何运用多种艺术手法实现创作意图,品味小说在形象、情节、语言等方面的独特魅力,欣赏小说不同的风格类型;学习用读书提要或读书笔记记录自己的阅读感受和见解,借鉴小说技法进行创作。","images":[{"src":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/2/27097b149275120c07fa03b6d8c7ac2a0ad20f8d.jpeg","alt":"","width":1701,"height":2386,"base62":"5zkVTDZM47yhNxsCc70irVVeA57"}],"links":[{"href":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/2/27097b149275120c07fa03b6d8c7ac2a0ad20f8d.jpeg","text":"","title":"","classes":"lightbox","has_image":true},{"href":"#p-11194-h-1","text":"#p-11194-h-1","title":"","classes":"anchor","has_image":false}],"attachments":[{"href":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/2/27097b149275120c07fa03b6d8c7ac2a0ad20f8d.jpeg","text":"","title":"","classes":"lightbox","has_image":true}]}]}